cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the accompanying paper."
title: "QEPF: Quantile-Based Effectiveness Persistence Function (R code)"
abstract: >-
  R code accompanying the paper "Quantile-Based Effectiveness Persistence
  Function: A Tail-Focused Metric with Theory, Estimation, and Application to
  Biosimilar Evaluation". It provides the nonparametric estimator of the
  quantile-based effectiveness persistence function P(u) = V(u)/Q(u), a
  permutation test of equal persistence, an equivalence test for tail shape,
  the tail-mean ratio, and the code for all simulation studies and the SMARTER
  trial analysis reported in the paper.
